{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser","kind":"std","title":"std.http.ChunkParser","sourcePath":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/std/#std.http.ChunkParser","file":"std/http/ChunkParser.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"std.http.ChunkParser","text":"std.http.ChunkParser"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.http.ChunkParser.ChunkParser","text":"std.http.ChunkParser.ChunkParser"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.http.ChunkParser.feed","text":"std.http.ChunkParser.feed"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.http.ChunkParser.init","text":"std.http.ChunkParser.init"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.http.ChunkParser.State","text":"std.http.ChunkParser.State"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.http.ChunkParser.std","text":"std.http.ChunkParser.std"},{"depth":2,"slug":"source","text":"Source code"}],"symbols":[{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig:1:13132","name":"std.http.ChunkParser","anchor":"std.http.ChunkParser","category":"container","sourceLine":1},{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig:3:13133","name":"std.http.ChunkParser.ChunkParser","anchor":"std.http.ChunkParser.ChunkParser","category":"alias","sourceLine":3},{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig:35:13137","name":"std.http.ChunkParser.feed","anchor":"std.http.ChunkParser.feed","category":"function","sourceLine":35},{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig:9:13135","name":"std.http.ChunkParser.init","anchor":"std.http.ChunkParser.init","category":"constant","sourceLine":9},{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig:14:13136","name":"std.http.ChunkParser.State","anchor":"std.http.ChunkParser.State","category":"container","sourceLine":14},{"id":"std/http/ChunkParser.zig:4:13134","name":"std.http.ChunkParser.std","anchor":"std.http.ChunkParser.std","category":"alias","sourceLine":4}],"html":"<div id=\"std.http.ChunkParser\"></div>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">Source line 1</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Parser for transfer-encoding: chunked.</p>\n</div>\n<h4>Fields</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>state: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.State\">State</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>chunk_len: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser\"><code>ChunkParser</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.init\"><code>init</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.State\"><code>State</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.feed\"><code>feed</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.http.ChunkParser.ChunkParser\"><h3><code>std.http.ChunkParser.ChunkParser</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L3\">Source line 3</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser\"><code>std.http.ChunkParser</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.http.ChunkParser.feed\"><h3><code>std.http.ChunkParser.feed</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L35\">Source line 35</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Returns the number of bytes consumed by the chunk size. This is always\nless than or equal to <code>bytes.len</code>.</p>\n<p>After this function returns, <code>chunk_len</code> will contain the parsed chunk size\nin bytes when <code>state</code> is <code>data</code>. Alternately, <code>state</code> may become <code>invalid</code>,\nindicating a syntax error in the input stream.</p>\n<p>If the amount returned is less than <code>bytes.len</code>, the parser is in the\n<code>chunk_data</code> state and the first byte of the chunk is at <code>bytes[result]</code>.</p>\n<p>Asserts <code>state</code> is neither <code>data</code> nor <code>invalid</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">feed</span>(p: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser\">ChunkParser</a>, bytes: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>p: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser\">ChunkParser</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>bytes: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>Example usage</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> feed {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> testing = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> data = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"Ff\\r\\nf0f000 ; ext\\n0\\r\\nffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff\\r\\n\"</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> p = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.init\">init</a>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> first = p.feed(data[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>), first);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0xff</span>), p.chunk_len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(.data, p.state);\n\n    p = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.init\">init</a>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> second = p.feed(data[first..]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">13</span>), second);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0xf0f000</span>), p.chunk_len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(.data, p.state);\n\n    p = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.init\">init</a>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> third = p.feed(data[first + second ..]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>), third);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>), p.chunk_len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(.data, p.state);\n\n    p = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser.init\">init</a>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> fourth = p.feed(data[first + second + third ..]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">16</span>), fourth);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0xffffffffffffffff</span>), p.chunk_len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> testing.expectEqual(.invalid, p.state);\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.http.ChunkParser.init\"><h3><code>std.http.ChunkParser.init</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">constant</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L9\">Source line 9</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/http/ChunkParser/#std.http.ChunkParser\">ChunkParser</a></code></code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.http.ChunkParser.State\"><h3><code>std.http.ChunkParser.State</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">container</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L14\">Source line 14</a></p>\n<h4>Fields</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>head_size</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>head_ext</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>head_r</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>data</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>data_suffix</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>data_suffix_r</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>invalid</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.http.ChunkParser.std\"><h3><code>std.http.ChunkParser.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L4\">Source line 4</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<details class=\"source-code\" id=\"source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><summary>Source code</summary><p><code>std/http/ChunkParser.zig</code></p><div class=\"source-grid\"><pre class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-copy-ignore=\"\"><code><a id=\"L1\" href=\"#L1\" tabindex=\"-1\">1</a>\n<a id=\"L2\" href=\"#L2\" tabindex=\"-1\">2</a>\n<a id=\"L3\" href=\"#L3\" tabindex=\"-1\">3</a>\n<a id=\"L4\" href=\"#L4\" tabindex=\"-1\">4</a>\n<a id=\"L5\" href=\"#L5\" tabindex=\"-1\">5</a>\n<a id=\"L6\" href=\"#L6\" tabindex=\"-1\">6</a>\n<a id=\"L7\" href=\"#L7\" tabindex=\"-1\">7</a>\n<a id=\"L8\" href=\"#L8\" tabindex=\"-1\">8</a>\n<a id=\"L9\" href=\"#L9\" tabindex=\"-1\">9</a>\n<a id=\"L10\" href=\"#L10\" tabindex=\"-1\">10</a>\n<a id=\"L11\" href=\"#L11\" tabindex=\"-1\">11</a>\n<a id=\"L12\" h